 !                                                                               
 ! This test calculates the energy and dipole moment                             
 ! of the water molecule at different levels of theory.                          
 ! Note that we consistently leave out the SS integrals                          
 ! by using the LVCORR option in the general section.                            
 !                                                                               
 **DIRAC                                                                         
 .TITLE                                                                          
 Water molecule. Restricted kinetic balance. Energies, dipole moment.            
 .WAVE F                                                                         
 .PROPER                                                                         
 .4INDEX                                                                         
 **HAMILTONIAN                                                                   
 .LVCORR                                                                         
 **WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                
 .DHF                                                                            
 .RELCCSD                                                                        
 *DHFCAL                                                                         
 .EVCCNV                                                                         
 1.0E-8                                                                          
 **PROPERTIES                                                                    
 .DIPOLE                                                                         
 **MOLTRA                                                                        
 .ACTIVE                                                                         
 all                                                                             
 *END OF                                                                         
                                                                                 
  &RELCCSD TIMING=T,                                                             
           DOSORT=T, DOENER=T, DOFOPR=T, DOSOPR=F &END                           
  &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T &END                                      
  &CCFOPR DOMP2G=T &END                                                          
                                                                                 


    **************************************************************************
    *********** Water molecule. Restricted kinetic balance. Energi ***********
    **************************************************************************

 Jobs in this run:
   * Wave function
   * Properties
   * Transformation to Molecular Spinor basis


